+/** GENERATED by tools/exit-footsteps/derive_footsteps.cjs (Voice Bot). Do not edit by hand; re-run the tool.
+ *  FOOTSTEP_PLANTS: heel-strike (foot plant) times in CLIP seconds per character clip, from the shipped GLB's shoe soles
+ *  (first sample within 4 mm of the root plane after a >= 10 mm lift; FK at 480 Hz), and x/z = where that sole
